@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Melihat Data Semester (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Data Semester ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses menu "Semester"
UI -> C: 2. Request data semester
C -> DB: 3. Get semesters data
DB --> C: 4. Return semesters list
C --> UI: 5. Load semesters page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan daftar semester

@enduml